      "writtenOn": "2025-09-25T14:08:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t quite right. The number of members *that have location attributes* must be `2`, but you can other members with `@builtin` attributes, e.g.:\n```\nstruct S {\n  @location(0) @blend_src(0) a: f32,\n  @location(0) @blend_src(1) b: f32,\n  @builtin(sample_mask) c : u32,\n}\n```",
      "revId": "fba2fd1d6d96b12ac20e5b2f41d8ff8691958d60",
